TrackMe 1.8.10 — your ride, worth sharing.

• Five new designs for sharing a ride: the route on its own, a data card, a transparent sticker for your own photos, one coloured by the light you rode in, and one that appears only when you beat a record.
• Pick several rides and share them as one picture — a journey with its stops named, or every route on one ground.
• Steadier recording when a ride is mostly stop-start, and a stop no longer drifts on a long halt.
